sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant C as AI Agent
    participant R as Retriever
    participant Q as Qdrant Vector DB
    participant G as Gemini API

    autonumber
    U->>F: Send message
    F->>A: Forward request (HTTP)
    A->>C: Route request (gRPC)
    C->>R: Search query (gRPC)
    R->>Q: Dense vector search by theme collection
    Q-->>R: Return semantic candidates
    Note over R: Build BM25 candidates from synced Qdrant payloads
    Note over R: Fuse dense + BM25 rankings using RRF, then BGE rerank
    R-->>C: Return top reranked chunks with metadata
    C->>G: Generate answer with context (via OpenRouter)
    G-->>C: Final answer with citation markers
    C-->>A: Return answer + sources
    A-->>F: Deliver answer
    F-->>U: Display answer

    Note over C, G: Total Latency <= 5 seconds
